### Enqueue a query (minimal)
POST http://ec2-3-88-176-142.compute-1.amazonaws.com/api/queue/enqueue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "pvh",
  "page_size": 10,
  "max_retry_attempts": 3
}

